@startuml
title Strijder Cadmium logical deployment
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam nodeBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #171922
skinparam nodeFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam componentBorderColor #9A79C9
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #191522
skinparam componentFontColor #F4F1E8

node "Dispatch workstation" {
  component "StrijderCadmium.Dispatch\n.NET 8 WPF" as Dispatch
  component "WebView2 / Mapbox" as DMap
  database "Local SQLite" as DDB
}

cloud "Cadmium service\nProduction backend TBD" as Service

node "Vision Pro EVS vehicle" {
  component "StrijderCadmium.Mdt\n.NET 8 WPF" as MDT
  component "WebView2 / Mapbox" as MMap
  database "Local SQLite + queue" as MDB
  component "Vision local API" as Vision
}

Dispatch <--> DMap : validated JSON bridge
Dispatch <--> DDB
Dispatch <--> Service : calls / units / messages
Service <--> MDT : durable synchronization
MDT <--> MMap : route / position / selection
MDT <--> MDB
MDT <--> Vision : health / context / event mark

note bottom of Service
  Proof version used one executable with
  switchable Dispatch and vehicle modes.
  Production target separates applications.
end note
@enduml
